OL,3,GNEWSANepalese community sends hope to
OL,4,Aflood-hit families
OL,5,
OL,6,FMembers of the Nepalese community in
OL,7,FKent have sent messages of hope and
OL,8,Fcomfort to those impacted by the
OL,9,Fdevastating flash flooding near the
OL,10,FNepal-Tibet border.
OL,12,FNepalese authorities reported 177
OL,13,Fpeople have died and more than 800 are
OL,14,Fmissing, including 33 UK tourists.
OL,16,FThe president of the Nepal Centre for
OL,17,FDisaster Management, Dr Bishal Nath
OL,18,FUpreti, said the situation was so dire
OL,19,Fthat "whole villages had been wiped
OL,20,Fout" and likened the flooding to a
OL,21,F"tsunami from the sky".
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
