OL,3,GNEWSANepalese community sends hope to
OL,4,Aflood-hit families
OL,5,
OL,6,FMedway Council's Nina Gurung, who is a
OL,7,Frepresentative of the Gurkha-Nepalese
OL,8,Fcommunity in the county, told BBC Radio
OL,9,FKent the situation was "absolutely
OL,10,Fshocking and devastating".
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
